# CHI ep ky tu xuong dong cho nhung file ma CRLF that su lam hong thu gi.
#
# Ban dau file nay co dong `* text=auto eol=lf` cho MOI file. Hau qua: cac blob
# da commit truoc do van giu CRLF, nen git bao lech vinh vien voi working tree va
# doi mot lan `git add --renormalize` ghi lai toan bo — mot commit hang nghin dong
# thuan ky tu xuong dong, khong dang.
#
# Van de that su can chan la khac: script chay tren Linux ma co CRLF thi shebang
# hong voi thong diep rat kho doc ("bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M"). Chi ep cho
# chung, va de git tu xu ly phan con lai.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Nhi phan: khong dung toi.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
